        বাংলা / Bangla.

        Financial terminology is translated where a settled Bangla term exists
        and Bangladeshi investors actually use it. Where the Bangla alone would
        be ambiguous, the English term is kept in brackets, which is how these
        figures are discussed in practice here: nobody says "মূলধন হার" without
        also saying "cap rate".

        Currency amounts, dates and figures are formatted by the app, not
        translated, so a taka figure reads the same in either language.
